@startuml
!define RECTANGLE class

title ClearML Agent System Architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "ClearML Agent" {
  [Kubernetes Glue] as glue
  [Service Pod] as servicepod
  [Worker Telemetry] as telemetry
  [Backend Service Client] as backendclient
  [Experiment Executor] as executor
}

package "External Systems" {
  [ClearML Server] as server
  [Kubernetes Cluster] as k8s
  [Docker Daemon] as docker
}

glue --> k8s : prepares jobs
glue --> server : retrieves jobs
servicepod --> docker : manages containers
servicepod --> executor : runs experiments
executor --> telemetry : reports status
telemetry --> server : sends reports\npings server
backendclient --> server : API calls
k8s --> executor : executes pods

note right of glue
  Converts queued jobs 
  to Kubernetes jobs 
  using YAML templates
end note

note right of servicepod
  Long-running pod 
  using clearml-agent image
end note

note right of telemetry
  Periodic status reporting
  Default: every 2 seconds
  Ping server every 30 seconds
end note

note right of backendclient
  Supports create, get, 
  get_by_id, get_all, 
  get_all_ex operations
end note

note right of executor
  Installs experiment 
  environment and monitors 
  experiment process
end note

note top of server
  ClearML Server
  - Experiment management
  - Visualization & collaboration
  - Data tracking
  - MLOps monitoring
end note

note bottom of k8s
  Kubernetes Cluster
  - Pods execution
  - Job orchestration
end note

note bottom of docker
  Docker Daemon
  - Sibling container management
  - Requires socket mapping
end note

@enduml
